<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - FEDSURE HALF YR EPS, DIV SURGE.</title>
<headline>TABLE - FEDSURE HALF YR EPS, DIV SURGE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr ended June 30</p>
<p>		(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		 73.2     vs 56.3</p>
<p>    Diluted shr (cts)     72.7     vs 57.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 45.5     vs 35.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   79.7     vs 58.8</p>
<p>    Income after tax	87.5     vs 66.6</p>
<p>Div payable September 5</p>
<p>On register August 22</p>
<p>Full name: Fedsure Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Insurer Fedsure said it would look to strengthen its core businesses both in South Africa and overseas. It added that, barring unforeseen circumstances, it should post real growth in earnings and dividends for the year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
